# GJ-Ecommerce agent workspace

## Canonical paths (do not duplicate elsewhere)

- Orientation: `@CLAUDE.md`, `@docs/onboarding.md`, `@docs/service-index.md`
- Subagents: `.claude/agents/` — invoke with `Task(subagent_type="<name>")` (e.g. `ensi-navigator`, `integration-engineer`)
- Skills: `.claude/skills/` — load when the task matches skill `description` (ensi-*, oms-*, site-*, mobile-*, integration-*, gloriaots-*, gj-*)
- Supplemental rules: `.claude/rules/` (this directory)

## Cursor vs Claude Code

| Concern | Claude Code | Cursor Agent |
|---------|-------------|----------------|
| Subagents | `Agent` / subagent | `Task(subagent_type=…)` |
| GSD | `/gsd:new-project`, `/gsd:plan-phase`, … in `.claude/commands/gsd/` | optional local `gsd-*` skills under `.cursor/skills/` (gitignored) or ask to run `gsd-new-project` |
| MCP Buddy | `mcp__gj-buddy__*` | `CallMcpTool` server `buddy-mcp` / `user-buddy-mcp`, tools `gitlab_*`, `data_logs_*`, `confluence_*`, … |

## Repository boundaries

- **No git** at workspace root `GJ-Ecommerce/` — only inside `platform/*/` clones
- **No commit** of GSD installer output (`.claude/commands/`, `get-shit-done/`, `.cursor/get-shit-done/`, `.cursor/skills/gsd-*`)
- **Do commit** changes under `.claude/agents/`, `.claude/skills/`, `.claude/rules/`, `docs/`, `CLAUDE.md`

## Platform code

- **Local first:** all platforms cloned in `platform/` — read/search via local tools after `./scripts/sync-platform-repos.sh` (see `@.claude/rules/local-code-first.mdc`)
- ENSI commands: `elc -w gj -c <service> exec …` — not host `composer`/`artisan`
- Large grep: exclude `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, `target/`, `dist/`; GitLab MCP only when repo is missing locally or for MR/CI (not for reading source)

## Research output

- **Tracked (short):** `docs/research/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md` — summary, priorities, next steps (~1–2 screens). See `docs/research/README.md`.
- **Local only (long):** `logs/research/` — autopsy, exception catalogs, log dumps. **`logs/README.md` is tracked**; everything else under `logs/` is gitignored.
- Prefer **one summary file per topic**; extend it instead of adding parallel research md files.
- Checkout / order creation index: `docs/research/2026-05-20-checkout-order-creation.md`.
